    "description": {
      "value": "<p><span class=\"GramE\"><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">宝石龙</span></em></strong></span><strong><em><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">起源</span></em></strong>。你的血脉可追溯到某只<span class=\"GramE\">宝石龙</span>身上，这赋予<span class=\"GramE\">你特殊</span>的魔法亲和。从<span class=\"GramE\">宝石龙</span>血脉表格中选择一项，这将决定<span class=\"GramE\">你其他</span>特性的伤害类型。<span>         <br></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"GramE\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">宝石龙</span></strong></span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体\">血脉</span></strong><span><br></span>龙种<span>         </span>伤害类型<span><br></span>紫水晶<span>      </span>力场<span><br></span>水晶<span>          </span>光耀<span><br></span>翡翠<span>          </span>心灵<span><br></span>蓝宝石<span>      </span>雷鸣<span><br></span>黄玉<span>         <span class=\"GramE\"> <span><span>黯蚀</span></span></span><br></span></p>",
